Mobile-first approach with these breakpoints:

| Breakpoint | Width  | Device        |
| ---------- | ------ | ------------- |
| `sm`       | 640px  | Large mobile  |
| `md`       | 768px  | Tablet        |
| `lg`       | 1024px | Desktop       |
